jack2-pistomp (1.9.22-8~pre2) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Pin netJACK2 unicast egress to an interface, not just the multicast join.
    On Linux JACK_NETJACK_MULTICAST_IF only set IP_MULTICAST_IF, so the RT
    stream back to the peer still followed the default route and could leave
    over Wi-Fi when both wired and Wi-Fi carried a 169.254 link-local address.
    The slave now also applies IP_UNICAST_IF; the master captures the arrival
    interface of each SLAVE_AVAILABLE via IP_PKTINFO, latches it, and pins
    every spawned master socket to it (IP_BOUND_IF / IP_UNICAST_IF).
  * Bump the fork pin to self-healing-jackbridge HEAD (2a4520f9).

 -- Cam Gorrie <sastraxi@gmail.com>  Thu, 28 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000

jack2-pistomp (1.9.22-8~pre1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Build from the TreeFallSound/jack2 fork instead of upstream + local quilt
    patches. The fork carries the Python 3.12 waf backport and the netadapter
    PI-controller reset (both dropped from debian/patches as a result), plus
    multicast interface pinning and the netJACK2 master-reaping fixes that
    stop a departed slave from stalling the master (NETJACK-REAPING.md).
  * Remaining quilt patches (db 5.3, systemd pkgconfig, systemd unit dir) are
    Debian-packaging-only and still apply on the fork.

 -- Cam Gorrie <sastraxi@gmail.com>  Wed, 27 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000

