jack2-pistomp (1.9.22-7~pre1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Conflict with, replace and provide libjack-jackd2-dev. The package
    ships /usr/include/jack, jack.pc and the libjack*.so dev symlinks,
    which libjack-jackd2-dev owns; without the relationship dpkg refuses
    to install jack2-pistomp on any system that already has Debian's dev
    package (e.g. the pi-gen build container).

